<title>USA: GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Florida 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Ryder</p>
<p>Cup team standings as issued by the PGA of America on Monday</p>
<p>(top 10 points winners automatically qualify for the 12-man</p>
<p>team to play Europe this September in Spain):</p>
<p>  1. Tom Lehman			  856.286 points</p>
<p>  2. Mark O'Meara			801.250</p>
<p>  3. Tiger Woods			 800.000</p>
<p>  4. Phil Mickelson		    659.286</p>
<p>  5. Scott Hoch			  645.280</p>
<p>  6. Brad Faxon			  642.500</p>
<p>  7. Davis Love			  636.000</p>
<p>  8. Steve Jones			 579.280</p>
<p>  9. Mark Brooks			 549.750</p>
<p> 10. Tommy Tolles			549.285</p>
<p> 11. Paul Stankowski		   473.334</p>
<p> 12. David Duval			 470.000</p>
<p> 13. Fred Couples			398.040</p>
<p> 14. John Cook			   376.000</p>
<p> 15. Kenny Perry			 371.250</p>
